# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## The Wilderness Bound update had lots of small technical changes which added up - so please report any Bugs you catch on our Discord server. 
## We also moved away from crowdin for our translations and now have our own solution. Feel free to contribute: https://explorerseden.eu/translate/
## Thank you!

## Changes:
- Crying Obsidian and Reinforced Deepslate can now be used as Nether Portal Frames
- Chopper blocks can now shear Pumpkins into Carved Pumpkins and Wool Blocks into Wool Stairs
- Added Kaleidoscope (can be crafted from 2 Iron Ingots and an Emerald)
- Redstone Wire, Redstone Torch, Repeater & Comparator blocks are no longer washed away by fluids
- Red-/Brown Mushrooms are now placeable on Grass, Dirt, Mud, Moss, Farmland Blocks regardless of the light level
- Added 17 progression advancements

## Fixes:
